    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akiteyenun nabo ŋuna ka amina a ŋina ka Akuj a ŋina ikilakuni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okolimok nabo Ekapolon ayoŋ tema, “Ape, kitoodik nabo amina kon neni a aberu aŋina aruwor ŋina a ekile a ece ka aruwor akaloman. Emaikina iyoŋ tominak iŋes lopite ŋolo aminar ayoŋ ŋituŋa a Isirael tari keminasi ikes ŋakujo ka tominas aayenen neni a ŋakujo ŋaboboryo ŋuna erukitoe esibit ŋamugati.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu ayoŋ ogyelu aberu ŋin a ŋisilipae a ŋitomon ka ŋikan ka a ŋikinyom a ŋulu esibit erau a ŋulu arae ŋakiloi amiat ka ŋatomonikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayoŋ olimok aberu ŋin otema, “Emaikina iyoŋ torubak irae aberu kaŋ ŋirwa ŋulu alalak, nyilosi nabo iyoŋ lokilyok ŋice, nyiryamakinosi iyoŋ ka ekile ece, kori ka ayoŋ daŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erae ŋun anerae epote Ŋisirael akiboi ŋirwa ŋulu alalak emam erwosit, kori ŋini emaikina kilunyokin lokicoloŋ a erwsoit, emam ŋamuronisya, kori ŋipirin ŋulu italeoritae, kori ŋitorubei a ŋakujo, kori ŋiboro ŋulu isitiyao ayenunia ŋakiro ŋuna ecamit Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku, eboŋunete Ŋisirael, kiwara Ekapolon Akuj kec ka Daudi erwosit kec; epote ikes anakuryanu neni ke Ekapolon ka epote ikes najokis keŋ ŋirwa ŋulu esidyok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
